fields.value:
{{Draftnotes
| name = Quill Spray
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus shd}} [[Toggling]] {{M|autocast}} off {{M|swaps-out}} this ability with {{A|Bristleback|Hairball}}.<br><br>Both abilities have independent {{M|cooldowns}}.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Grants 1 {{A|Bristleback|Warpath}} stack upon cast or when {{M|autocast}}.
** Interrupts Rigwarl's {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.
** {{Symbol|Target|No}}
*** The ability effects are centered and do not follow Rigwarl upon cast at the cast location.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
**# {{Symbol|fx|v}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
**#* The [[projectiles]] cannot be {{M|disjointed}}.
**#* Affects all valid enemy units within the radius, and does not expands [[Wikipedia:Circle|circularly]].
**# Checks for current number of stacks the debuff-affected unit has while applying {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|bristleback_quill_spray_stack}}.
**# Deals the following {{M|physical}} {{M|spell damage}} per cast:
**#* {{cf|expr}} {{Code|f(n) {{=}} BaseDmg + StackDmg × n , MAX {{=}} {{#var:Quill Spray value3}}}}
**#* Requires {{calc|1+ceil(({{#var:Quill Spray value3}}-v1)/{{#var:Quill Spray value5}})|v1={{#var:Quill Spray value4}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|1+ceil(({{#var:Quill Spray value3}}-v1)/{{#var:Quill Spray value5 tal}})|v1={{#var:Quill Spray value4}}}}|20tal}}) stacks to reach max spell damage.
**# Increases the number of debuff stacks.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}}
*** {{Code|bristleback_quill_spray}}
**** The first applied debuff displays the stack amount on the [[HUD]], subsequent stacks increases the value of this debuff.
*** {{Code|bristleback_quill_spray_stack}}
**** The stack debuff is applied at the same time as the previous debuff, with each stack debuff duration independent of the other.
** Hence, reapplying the debuff increases the spell damage applied, but does not refresh the stack duration.
** Affects the following units:
*** {{M|Couriers}}
*** {{M|Fogged}} units.
*** {{M|Invisible}} units.
*** {{M|Untargetable}} units.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Quill Spray icon0}}
| desc = Sprays enemy units with quills dealing damage in an area of effect around Bristleback.  Deals bonus damage for every time a unit was hit by Quill Spray in the last 14 seconds.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Speed}}
** Has {{#var:Quill Spray value2}}-[[projectile speed]] and travels up to a max {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Quill Spray value1}}/{{#var:Quill Spray value2}} round2}} seconds within the radius upon cast.

* Can stack up to a max of {{#expr:ceil({{#var:Quill Spray value6}}/{{#var:Quill Spray cd}})}} times considering both the ability {{M|cooldown}} and stack duration.

* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** The {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|bristleback_quill_spray}}-affected enemy units visually have spikes on their unit model.

