}}
* {{Symbol|fx|v}} {{Symbol|fx|s}}
** The passive ability plays a sound effect and visually indicates whenever Rigwarl's rear receives damage.

* Has the following increased effective health:
** {{calc|v1/(1-v1) round2|v1={{#var:Bristleback value3}}|%}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1/(1-v1) round2|v1={{#var:Bristleback value3 tal}}|%}}|15tal}}) when recieving rear damage.
** {{calc|v1/(1-v1) round2|v1={{#var:Bristleback value4}}|%}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1/(1-v1) round2|v1={{#var:Bristleback value4 tal}}|%}}|15tal}}) when recieveing side damage.
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}}
** The active component is a [[Wikipedia:Circular sector|circular sector]] from Rigwarl's current position.
** {{Symbol|Facing Angle|l}} {{hi|Bristleback}} [[File:Dota2 Bristleback Bristleback Segment agh icon.png|84px|The ability upgrade visualized.]]
*** Has a {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#explode:{{#var:Bristleback type2 value4 agh}}|°}}/360*pi*{{Show|A|Bristleback|Quill Spray|value1}} round2}}|agh}} [[area-of-effect]].
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|(θ / 360°) × r , r {{=}} [[#Quill Spray|QuillSprayEffectRadius]]}}
** {{Symbol|Turn Rate}}
*** The [[turn rate]] is given as degrees per second, instead of radians per {{M|server tick}}.
*** Has a {{#expr:{{#explode:{{#var:Bristleback type3 value2 agh}}|°}}*{{G|deg to turn rate}}}}-turn rate ({{Code|{{#expr:{{#explode:{{#var:Bristleback type3 value2 agh}}|°}}*{{G|deg to rad}}}} [[Wikipedia:Radian|rad]]}}).

